    "별 \\(review.stars)개 서평 때문에 이 책은 \\(Self.percent(Critics.salesMultiplier(for: review.stars))) 팔립니다.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Due to its \\(review.stars)-star review, this book sells at \\(Self.percent(Critics.salesMultiplier(for: review.stars)))."
