    "품절 · 재판 \\(Format.integer(reprint.copies))부 \\(max(1, Int((reprint.due.timeIntervalSince(now) / 3600).rounded(.up))))시간 뒤": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
